---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Best Cities in Spain"
  description="Privacy policy for bestcitiesinspain.com — analytics, cookies, affiliate links, and your data."
>
  <div style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 1.5rem;">
    <h1
      class="font-bold mb-3"
      style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; color: #1A1A1A; font-size: 2.25rem; line-height: 1.2;"
    >
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-sm" style="color: #6B7280;">Last updated: February 2026</p>

    <div class="prose-city">
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses Plausible Analytics, a privacy-first tool that collects no personal data and sets no cookies. No consent banner is required. Plausible does not track you across sites or sell your data.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        If display advertising is active on this site, third-party vendors including Google may use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalised advertising at <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">google.com/settings/ads</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you click and make a booking or purchase, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. This never influences which cities or services we recommend. See our <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a> for full details.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Controller</h2>
      <p>
        Best Cities in Spain is operated as an independent website. For any data-related enquiries, including requests under GDPR, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@bestcitiesinspain.com">hello@bestcitiesinspain.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Rights (GDPR)</h2>
      <p>
        If you are based in the European Union, you have the right to access, rectify, or erase any personal data we hold about you. Since we use Plausible Analytics (which holds no personal data) and do not operate contact forms, the only personal data we may hold is your email address if you have contacted us directly. To request deletion, email <a href="mailto:hello@bestcitiesinspain.com">hello@bestcitiesinspain.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        This policy may be updated periodically. The date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
